WEBVTT

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:09.510
See you next time.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Yeah.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:16.460
Yeah.

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:02.170
Mama, do I look good on you?

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:10.440
I'm sure I'll meet a wonderful person and have a happy marriage like my mother.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:15.660
I'll be happy.

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:19.000
So, mama, please support me from heaven.

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:21.120
I'll treasure this mother's body.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:22.760
Mama?

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:29.110
What?

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:35.620
Sakura?

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:48.190
I was watching your wedding album, and I suddenly wanted to come.

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:50.520
Didn't you go?

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.740
No, I was just a little surprised.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:54.660
Then I'll go out.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.420
I'll be late when I get home, so you can go to bed first.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:02.380
Take a picture!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:03.300
Huh?

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:33.500
Today is the soccer tournament, right?

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:34.360
Did you forget?

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.460
The game is about to start.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.510
Take off your clothes quickly and hurry up.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:40.070
Haha!

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:41.280
That's right!

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:45.540
Oh, it's raining.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:46.680
Let go of me.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:51.150
I'm in a hurry.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.740
I'll be in trouble if you don't take care of me.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:03.260
Yes.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:13.690
Love Wave Tent. Something for...

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:19.240
It's all thanks to you.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.040
Why are you wearing a wedding dress?

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:24.630
Well, you know.

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:26.390
There's no rehearsal for the wedding ceremony.

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.420
I have a boyfriend.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:34.250
Before I put on my shoes, I'll be with my boyfriend!

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:39.310
That's right, but...

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:41.890
You're so mean!

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:19.250
My name is Kazuya Nagiba. I'm a soccer club captain of the ace striker team.

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:23.290
I'm a big fan of you.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:25.680
Hey, hey, you two.

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:27.820
Let me take a picture of you.

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:29.340
Hey, what are you doing?

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:31.440
You're in my way.

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:32.280
What?

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:38.800
Because my dad is a professional cameraman.

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:42.370
But I don't have the right to film.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:43.190
Hey!

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:08.510
I'm the one who has to be the one to praise your heart!

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:16.250
It's me who has to be the one to praise your heart!

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:17.980
It's embarrassing to say that.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:22.880
I was aiming for a high score.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:23.980
What?

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:24.700
What?

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:39.760
Then, that girl's friendship is a fragile thing, isn't it?

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:49.540
Do something for that?

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:59.640
I'm the one who's going to do it!

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:23.970
That's what you guys are!

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:33.170
I want to put a soccer game on the school newspaper.

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:37.190
So I thought I'd have a victory interview with today's hero.

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:39.620
I interviewed Kazuyo Yanagiba.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:43.500
Don't go into the ground on your own.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:45.550
Even after the game is over.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:46.910
It's a top girl.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.450
I don't know when the ball will fly.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:53.140
And the captain is busy.

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:54.800
I refuse to interview.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:56.330
Please.

00:07:57.730 --> 00:07:58.250
Just a little person.

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:12.680
You're such a bad guy!

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:16.330
I'm Yosuke Tsuchuma, a first-year student and a keeper's assistant.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.910
You're so cheeky and you're so cheeky!

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:21.220
Assistant...

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:24.060
Asame...

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.120
Please give me the title!

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:33.990
It's better to eat yellow than to eat yellow.

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:35.950
Momoko is still blue.

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:38.760
I can't fight when I'm hungry.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:40.950
Let's save this place for a while and eat it.

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:42.090
Save?

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:45.500
Yanagiba-senpai won't give it to you.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:46.680
Me too.

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:49.530
As for that, I'll leave it there.

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:57.740
Which one should I choose?

00:08:57.840 --> 00:08:59.500
I like strawberries.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:03.750
But it's hard to throw away the vanilla, and the banana is hard to throw away.

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:05.400
Chocolate is good, too.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:06.420
Hello?

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:09.620
Hello?

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:12.540
Hello?

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:23.520
Two centimeters each.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:24.560
Two centimeters.

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:25.280
I know.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:26.840
Momoko, don't cheat.

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:29.000
I can't believe you're eating one bite at a time.

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:30.880
Isn't it a little messy?

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:32.480
Don't worry about it.

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:34.900
It's a good idea to enjoy three flavors at once.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:37.580
Then I'll go.

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:18.480
Chihiro is number one!

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:18.720
Banana!

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:20.990
I'm Colette!

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:56.150
If you don't give it to me honestly, I won't guarantee my life.

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:58.910
If I treasure it, I can use it for the rest of my life.

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:00.930
There is only one life.

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:03.280
You don't want to lose it, do you?

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.980
Then I'll give it to you honestly!

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:15.040
BABYLON!

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:45.160
Get out of here!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:13.070
Who are you, Limone?

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:17.040
Furyu, I won't give you the Devil Clan the Saint-Something-Four!

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:19.760
What? How cheeky!

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:25.720
The Devil Clan? The Saint-Something-Four? What are you talking about?

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:27.660
Limone! Don't get in my way!

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:11.470
You're going to get cursed, my love.

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:13.530
You're going to get cursed, my love.

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:14.380
You're going to get cursed, my love.

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:14.540
I'm in your way!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.980
You must defeat your enemy and sneak into their hearts!

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.570
You must defeat your enemy and sneak into their hearts!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.110
Momoko, give it to Ruby.

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:34.050
Give it to her honestly.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:37.770
Yuri? Hinagi-kun? What's wrong?

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:40.840
Give it to her! Give it to her!

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:41.480
What?

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:46.700
Yuri, Hinagi-kun, we're friends, right?

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:47.880
What?

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:48.500
What?

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:01.080
Be careful!

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.500
Those kids are possessed by the devil!

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:03.860
Ah!

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:11.500
In the way!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:12.880
In the way!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.980
In the way!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:19.770
The devil's pets are the Jamapi of the Ojama clan.

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:24.200
You're the only one who can throw them out of their bodies.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:28.250
Transform into the angel of love, Wedding Peach!

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:31.480
Wedding Pitch?

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:42.330
Saint Miroware!

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:49.840
Saint Miroware...

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:53.340
Wedding Pitch?

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:07.610
Momoko, I'm going to give you a wedding beautiful flower and a spell of love.

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:11.460
Why my name? Who are you?

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.860
I'm Aphrodite, the goddess of love and beauty.

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:16.540
I'm Aphrodite, the goddess of love and beauty.

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:21.290
When the wave of love increases, you will be able to become an angel of love.

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:24.800
If you want to save your friends, hurry up.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.060
Thanks for watching!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:40.980
She's so beautiful!

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:46.350
She's an angel!

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:49.850
The legendary angel of love, Wedding Peach!

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:50.890
I knew it!

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:51.580
That girl!

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:53.740
I'm your opponent!

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:01.920
The wedding dress you're wearing is...

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:03.300
is wrapped in a wave of love.

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:06.080
A wave of love?

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:07.600
Wedding Peach

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:09.060
I will fight the devil.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:18.930
Thank you for watching!

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:37.260
At the park where cherry blossoms bloom on this good day to celebrate the happiness of spring,

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:40.160
I won't allow a cute girl to be cursed by evil!

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:45.360
My partner, Wedding Peach, is in a very good mood!

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:46.140
I'm going to hit you!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.840
What are you talking about?

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:49.280
Give me Ruby's ring!

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:57.070
I can't fight Yuriyahinagiku!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.520
Wedding Peach...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.600
Using that bouquet, I'll use Lovely Operation Tampid to drive Jamaphy out.

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:05.660
With a bouquet?

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:27.130
Don't let Jamaphy confuse you!

00:18:31.050 --> 00:18:31.810
It was a good thing, wasn't it?

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:32.880
Let's go!

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:34.270
REMEMBER ME!

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:13.260
The memories of Yuri and Hinagiku

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:15.320
The warmth...

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:35.880
Limone!

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:38.010
I will definitely settle this!

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:39.170
That's what I want.

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:40.220
Hmph.

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:56.970
Wedding Peach

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:01.260
You did well.

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:36.180
What are you talking about?

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:40.000
Inagi-kun, Yuri, are you okay?

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:41.170
Huh?

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:42.280
