00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:42.860
Hm?

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:45.690
Momoko, you had a weird dream, didn't you?

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.270
Eh? Eh? Eh?

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:48.620
