00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:54.600
But I transformed into Wedding Peach!

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:56.740
Wedding Peach?

00:20:57.180 --> 00:20:57.680
That's right!

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.970
Look, this beautiful wedding dress...

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:04.210
What the hell is going on?

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:06.530
This guy is weird.

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:07.810
It's always the same.

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:10.610
I wonder if he was dreaming after all.

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:12.560
Geez, I can't go out with him.

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:15.400
He's really a troublesome person.

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:16.520
He's weird.

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:34.960
It's not a dream.

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:36.540
It's definitely not a dream.

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:01.160
I don't know what to do.

00:23:01.260 --> 00:23:05.970
My best friend Yuriyahinagiku will make a bento for her beloved Yanagiba-senpai and give her a treat.

00:23:06.510 --> 00:23:07.950
Yosuke will eat my lunch.

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:09.610
The devil will come to steal my mom's finger ring.

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:12.620
Oh, come on!

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:14.090
I'm in such a bad mood!

00:23:15.030 --> 00:23:17.540
Next time, Wedding Peach!

00:23:17.780 --> 00:23:18.870
Appare!

00:23:18.930 --> 00:23:19.730
Oiro Naoshi!

00:23:19.930 --> 00:23:22.400
I'll give you a wave of love.
